'' A ustring array initialised from an ALL-NARROW concatenation -- '{ bs & "!" }' over a string
'' bs -- folds narrow and transcodes once, as an assignment does (LowerNarrowChainToU_). The
'' element initialiser tried only the ustring chain, declined, and stopped the build (TKO0994).
'' Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/ustr-array-narrow-chain.bas -o tests/codegen/ustrarraynarrowchain.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/ustrarraynarrowchain.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/ustrarraynarrowchain.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: A:bytes!|x|bytesbytes|10
